{"id":"649052f5ff4caaa5","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-cographchar.md","title":"Induced-path and recursive-decomposition characterizations of cographs","display":"thm-cographchar — Induced-path and recursive-decomposition characterizations of cographs","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-cographchar","aliases":["27-thm-cographchar"],"display":"thm-cographchar — Induced-path and recursive-decomposition characterizations of cographs","depends_on":["[[27-df-cograph]]","[[27-df-graphops]]","[[27-df-cooccurrence]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§10.4 Theorem 10.7","source_printed_pages":"464–466","source_pdf_pages":"488–490","verification_status":"source-equivalence-and-proof-checked","local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-cographchar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-cographchar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cographchar — Induced-path and recursive-decomposition characterizations of cographs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"335657d6abd50434\" href=\"?note=335657d6abd50434\" title=\"27-df-cograph\">27-df-cograph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9c8c1483ec65329c\" href=\"?note=9c8c1483ec65329c\" title=\"27-df-graphops\">27-df-graphops</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f58350b3b48133a\" href=\"?note=7f58350b3b48133a\" title=\"27-df-cooccurrence\">27-df-cooccurrence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§10.4 Theorem 10.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"464–466"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"488–490"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-equivalence-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\">\\(G=(V,E)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"335657d6abd50434\" href=\"?note=335657d6abd50434\" title=\"27-df-cograph\">27-df-cograph</a> 的非空有限简单图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(V\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。诱导子图、补图及图投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Vert},\\mathrm{Edges}\">\\(\\mathrm{Vert},\\mathrm{Edges}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9c8c1483ec65329c\" href=\"?note=9c8c1483ec65329c\" title=\"27-df-graphops\">27-df-graphops</a> 及其上游 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"448689b85eeddd41\" href=\"?note=448689b85eeddd41\" title=\"27-df-graph\">27-df-graph</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 是任意有限简单图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conn}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conn}\\)</span> 是下式定义的图谓词，二元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7f58350b3b48133a\" href=\"?note=7f58350b3b48133a\" title=\"27-df-cooccurrence\">27-df-cooccurrence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cograph}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cograph}\\)</span> 取上述定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conn}(H)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a,b\\in\\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathrm{Vert}(H)^{\\{0,\\ldots,q\\}}\\;\n\\left(v_0=a\\land v_q=b\\land\\forall j\\in\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:t&lt;q\\}\\;(\\{v_j,v_{j+1}\\}\\in\\mathrm{Edges}(H))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Conn}(H)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a,b\\in\\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathrm{Vert}(H)^{\\{0,\\ldots,q\\}}\\;\n\\left(v_0=a\\land v_q=b\\land\\forall j\\in\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:t&lt;q\\}\\;(\\{v_j,v_{j+1}\\}\\in\\mathrm{Edges}(H))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists a,b,c,d\\in V\\;\n\\left(|\\{a,b,c,d\\}|=4\\land E\\cap\\binom{\\{a,b,c,d\\}}2=\\{\\{a,b\\},\\{b,c\\},\\{c,d\\}\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists a,b,c,d\\in V\\;\n\\left(|\\{a,b,c,d\\}|=4\\land E\\cap\\binom{\\{a,b,c,d\\}}2=\\{\\{a,b\\},\\{b,c\\},\\{c,d\\}\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cograph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cograph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cograph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall S\\subseteq V\\;\n\\left(|S|&gt;1\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Conn}(G[S])\\lor\\neg\\mathrm{Conn}(\\overline{G[S]})\\bigr)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cograph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall S\\subseteq V\\;\n\\left(|S|&gt;1\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Conn}(G[S])\\lor\\neg\\mathrm{Conn}(\\overline{G[S]})\\bigr)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 10.7，印刷 pp.464–466／PDF pp.488–490。分解条件递归按图或补图的连通分量生成并/连接；并与连接不产生诱导P4。最后方向采用书中的交替扩充顶点论证：若图及补图同时连通且无P4，可逐步强迫最后顶点孤立或支配，矛盾。这里补图在诱导子图自身的顶点集上取，未沿用错误环境载体。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-cograph","status":"resolved","id":"335657d6abd50434","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cograph]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-graphops","status":"resolved","id":"9c8c1483ec65329c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-graphops]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cooccurrence","status":"resolved","id":"7f58350b3b48133a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cooccurrence]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cograph","status":"resolved","id":"335657d6abd50434","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,E)$ 是 [[27-df-cograph]] 的非空有限简单图，$V\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。诱导子图、补图及图投影 $\\mathrm{Vert},\\mathrm{Edges}$ 见 [[27-df-graphops]] 及其上游 [[27-df-graph]]。$H$ 是任意有限简单图；$\\mathrm{Conn}$ 是下式定义的图谓词，二元谓词 $\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E)$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]。$\\mathrm{Cograph}$ 取上述定义。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-graphops","status":"resolved","id":"9c8c1483ec65329c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,E)$ 是 [[27-df-cograph]] 的非空有限简单图，$V\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。诱导子图、补图及图投影 $\\mathrm{Vert},\\mathrm{Edges}$ 见 [[27-df-graphops]] 及其上游 [[27-df-graph]]。$H$ 是任意有限简单图；$\\mathrm{Conn}$ 是下式定义的图谓词，二元谓词 $\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E)$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]。$\\mathrm{Cograph}$ 取上述定义。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"448689b85eeddd41","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,E)$ 是 [[27-df-cograph]] 的非空有限简单图，$V\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。诱导子图、补图及图投影 $\\mathrm{Vert},\\mathrm{Edges}$ 见 [[27-df-graphops]] 及其上游 [[27-df-graph]]。$H$ 是任意有限简单图；$\\mathrm{Conn}$ 是下式定义的图谓词，二元谓词 $\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E)$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]。$\\mathrm{Cograph}$ 取上述定义。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cooccurrence","status":"resolved","id":"7f58350b3b48133a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,E)$ 是 [[27-df-cograph]] 的非空有限简单图，$V\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。诱导子图、补图及图投影 $\\mathrm{Vert},\\mathrm{Edges}$ 见 [[27-df-graphops]] 及其上游 [[27-df-graph]]。$H$ 是任意有限简单图；$\\mathrm{Conn}$ 是下式定义的图谓词，二元谓词 $\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E)$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]。$\\mathrm{Cograph}$ 取上述定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"V\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Vert},\\mathrm{Edges}","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cograph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conn}(H)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a,b\\in\\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathrm{Vert}(H)^{\\{0,\\ldots,q\\}}\\;\n\\left(v_0=a\\land v_q=b\\land\\forall j\\in\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:t<q\\}\\;(\\{v_j,v_{j+1}\\}\\in\\mathrm{Edges}(H))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists a,b,c,d\\in V\\;\n\\left(|\\{a,b,c,d\\}|=4\\land E\\cap\\binom{\\{a,b,c,d\\}}2=\\{\\{a,b\\},\\{b,c\\},\\{c,d\\}\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cograph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{P4Free}(V,E).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cograph}(G)\\Longleft